{%- comment -%}
  HEADER + FULL-SCREEN MENU — see snippets/lbass-menu.liquid.

  Rendered from HERE and not from lbass-entity-schema for a hard reason:
  entity-schema is rendered inside <head>. A <button> or <div> there makes the
  parser implicitly close <head> and open <body>, so everything after it —
  including content_for_header and the main stylesheet — would be reparsed as
  body content. This snippet is one of the few that renders at BODY level on
  BOTH templates/index.liquid ({% layout none %}) and layout/theme.liquid,
  which is exactly what server-rendered menu markup needs.

  Server-rendered on purpose: the menu needs crawlable category links, and
  JS-built navigation is not crawlable.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'lbass-menu' %}

{%- comment -%} Category card legibility — see snippets/lbass-cards-fix.liquid. {%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'lbass-cards-fix' %}

{%- comment -%}
  pSEO guide → shop / article bridge — see snippets/lbass-pseo-links.liquid.
  Self-gates on template.suffix == 'pseo', so it is inert everywhere else.
  It lives here because templates/page.pseo.liquid is 46KB of hardcoded
  per-handle content and does NOT render {{ page.content }}, so there was no
  cheap in-template hook.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'lbass-pseo-links' %}

{%- comment -%}
  HOMEPAGE BRAND PROOF BLOCK (2026-08-05) — the multilingual "شنو هو" section.
  Rendered from here for the same structural reason as the menu above: this is
  one of the only snippets that reaches templates/index.liquid, which declares
  {% layout none %} and so never runs layout/theme.liquid. Without this hook
  the homepage would be the only page on the site with no entity statement.
  Full rationale in snippets/lbass-cro-tracking-hook.liquid.

  Gated to the homepage: every other template already gets the four-language
  lbass-entity-block in the footer via theme.liquid, and two "what is Lbass
  Original" blocks on one page is padding, not SEO.
{%- endcomment -%}


